  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "願望"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>蘇鳳嬌</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī樹林內底，有獅、猴、象、貓熊、兔仔等等一寡動物，in圍一个圓箍仔，hiânn柴烘火，做伙leh討論家己ê願望。逐家討論了真歡喜，m̄-koh kan-na貓熊lóng無出聲、講話。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">象就問--伊：「Kám講你lóng無啥mih願望？」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">貓熊應講：「其實mā有--lah！M̄-koh，ná親像無kài好實現。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">其他ê動物就鼓勵伊講：「你講看māi--leh--lah！無定，阮ē-tàng kā你tàu-sann-kāng--啊！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">貓熊就講：「我tsit世人，就kan-na tsit个願望，就是hip一張仔彩色相片～」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐个lóng笑kah kiōng-beh píng--過……。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">（Tsit篇文章是高雄市岡山社區大學「手寫台文、口說台語」班ê學生投稿）</p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEirHGAM7P5gQtncbsZwob-Xg5QHZDq5q-tHfzn-c75AvbOcPM4UV60SATUckd3nQoVpF2QTEdxejOwwNnJ8EpS10UIOUMf-pIVsj8rRtWHV9H0ogJaNCDiLGP3n_iFjJhsusPfBQ8J3ervHzpaLvp06aaVzFW-_HRM4_JGvVovB5T840q2i3MVloZAbTWo0/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1359%E6%9C%9F_019_a.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEirHGAM7P5gQtncbsZwob-Xg5QHZDq5q-tHfzn-c75AvbOcPM4UV60SATUckd3nQoVpF2QTEdxejOwwNnJ8EpS10UIOUMf-pIVsj8rRtWHV9H0ogJaNCDiLGP3n_iFjJhsusPfBQ8J3ervHzpaLvp06aaVzFW-_HRM4_JGvVovB5T840q2i3MVloZAbTWo0/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1359%E6%9C%9F_019_a.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhDJn1b4-aXdPVniou3PG9UsKNs2yDx83H9Z7CC2XsRHlFthbhm6ywKTosMqfdYpJgwSi7-4HWM3Mgkt2Qi7Xex7s7scF0zg9EuhNvVaKCLvDy71SWfDIFZW7TFhVJ4a2m-LpqpQdeLHnMqEiOQLfPLj3mK6v4zcGjKg_ugSxTEoucGFAorBXLet8ZSuHA0/s1423/359%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1423\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhDJn1b4-aXdPVniou3PG9UsKNs2yDx83H9Z7CC2XsRHlFthbhm6ywKTosMqfdYpJgwSi7-4HWM3Mgkt2Qi7Xex7s7scF0zg9EuhNvVaKCLvDy71SWfDIFZW7TFhVJ4a2m-LpqpQdeLHnMqEiOQLfPLj3mK6v4zcGjKg_ugSxTEoucGFAorBXLet8ZSuHA0/w450-h640/359%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">